{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:39 2026-05-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:39 2026-05-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:39 2026-05-28 HKT</p><img alt=\"公務員加薪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ae97abd6380e80b361c80065d500bde/2026-05/177909233236473.jpg\"/><p>影響公務員加薪的薪酬趨勢調查結果揭盅。按慣例，政府會從各薪金級別的「薪酬趨勢總指標」減去相關薪金級別的公務員遞增薪額開支，以得出「薪酬趨勢淨指標」。公務員事務局局長楊何蓓茵中午（28日）12點見記者，公布2026年薪酬趨勢調查初步結果。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b8ce5131c45ede73ff788ae8227476e/2026-05/177909233236473_0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4a927afdfb461d764ff4bba9911f7e5/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20250916_112228813_05.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7cdd180ea54013826b00313971615d3d/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20250916_111326631_01.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0100a10a1bf8cfbe7ad39634b284ba7/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20250916_111326631_04.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/780e06342f1c1741690617a9d483a5c8/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20250916_111326631_11.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-28T03:58:50.509186+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}